er":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider\/monoColorBgDefaultHover","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemebuttoncomponenttokensprovider\/monocolorbgdefaulthover","title":"monoColorBgDefaultHover","abstract":[{"text":"Has for value token MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: colors.repositoryOpacityBlackHigher, dark: colors.repositoryOpacityWhiteHigher) (= light: “#000000AD” \/ dark: “#FFFFFFCC”)","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"monoColorBgDefaultHover","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"component  tokens of buttons","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"button"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSButton"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllButtonComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ButtonComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"buttons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Button"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), borders"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"role":"symbol","title":"OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemebuttoncomponenttokensprovider","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider/monoColorContentDefaultEnabled":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider\/monoColorContentDefaultEnabled","url":"\/d